From d81c0776e83fbe610235826b8d827cbac9209947 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andreas Scherer <andreas_github@freenet.de>
Date: Mon, 18 May 2026 15:48:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 48/49] Prepare SGB for CPLUSPLUS23.

Compile with Apple clang 21.0.0 and --std=c++23.

* sprintf is deprecated: Replace with snprintf.
  Be extra carefull with appended material (pointers p and q)!
* register is not allowed in C++17.
* C++ keyword compl must be replaced.

This finishes issue #10. 'make tests demos' compiles with
C23 and C++23 flawlessly. It doesn't get better than this.
